==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 75,000 and increases by 25,000 with each stage.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

